      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm! You don't have a medical license, do you? It's alright, I've heard about a rogue, unlicensed physician who performed medical miracles! But... That might have been a comic book.",
      "translation" : "嗯！你沒有行醫執照吧？沒關係，我聽說過有個非法行醫的醫生創造過醫療奇蹟！不過...也可能是漫畫裡的情節。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh whatever. Just don't get caught.",
      "translation" : "隨便吧。別被抓到就行。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You guy~",
      "translation" : "你這傢伙~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Check the requirements again.",
      "translation" : "再檢查一下需求。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't look like an idiot though. So c'mon man, get real.",
      "translation" : "你看起來也不像笨蛋。所以振作點，面對現實吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ooh~! You have good fashion sense. I know you've had a hard time collecting this stuff, but this hat is worth it. Take it. All you need now is a fur coat and a cane!",
      "translation" : "哦~！你的時尚品味不錯。我知道收集這些東西很辛苦，不過這頂帽子絕對值得。拿去吧。現在你只差一件毛皮大衣和一根手杖了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You guy~",
      "translation" : "你這傢伙~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go check my requirements again. You don't look like an idiot though. C'mon man, get real.",
      "translation" : "再檢查一下我的需求。你看起來也不像笨蛋。振作點，面對現實吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This one? It's a little bit scary, though it has some sort of romantic quality. What do you think? You like it? Alright, take it, it's yours!",
      "translation" : "這頂嗎？有點嚇人，不過也帶著些浪漫氣息。你覺得呢？喜歡嗎？好吧，拿去吧，是你的了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Buffoon. Go check the requirements again. ^3355FFPhantom of Opera^000000 isn't easy to come by. So c'mon man, get real.",
      "translation" : "笨蛋。再檢查一下需求。^3355FF歌劇之假面^000000可不容易弄到。振作點，面對現實吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you have a chance to visit the Uplander Village, Payon, please go and meet the Sakkat Craftsman.",
      "translation" : "如果你有機會去普隆德拉的高原村落斐揚，記得去見見笠帽工匠。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He's never sold Sakkat to Traders other than me, since only I can recognize its quality. Due to its rarity, Sakkat has become a very unique and exceptional product. Okay! Take it, it's yours!",
      "translation" : "除了我，他從不把笠帽賣給其他商人，因為只有我懂得鑑別它的品質。由於十分稀有，笠帽成了獨特而珍貴的商品。好了！拿去吧，是你的了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Trader",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Trader]",
      "translation" : "[商人]"
    },
